<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Hero (the commander) and troop characters of Commander Battle's troop classes (cb_mpclassdivisions.xml), merged into
  Native's mpcharacters.xml (MPCharacters, MultiplayerGame only). All new ids: the stock characters stay untouched.
  - default_group sets the class group, hence the role (Infantry, Ranged, Cavalry, HorseArcher).
  - Bots draw every equipment slot from a random roster of their character (Equipment.GetRandomEquipmentElements with a
    seed rolls again per slot), so each slot holds the same kind of item in every roster: the rosters vary the looks,
    never the loadout. Weapons are the same in every roster; the weapon setups (perks) swap them.
  - Slots: Item0 main weapon, Item1 shield (or bolts), Item2 sidearm, Item3 the crossbowmen's pavise. Cape the knights'
    pauldron cape.
  - Gear tiers: light = levy (padded or gambeson, a real helmet, a decent shield, a proper weapon); medium = common
    men-at-arms (mail, a good helmet); heavy = dismounted knights and knights (the culture's best armour and weapons).
  - Items only from Native's mpitems.xml.
-->
